OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FVariable amounts of cloud and
OL,6,Fsome bright or sunny spells. A few
OL,7,Fshowers will break out through the day
OL,8,Fbut some places will stay largely dry.
OL,9,
OL,10,CTonight:FAny showers will die away
OL,11,Fthrough this evening. Then the rest of
OL,12,Fthe night will be mainly dry with
OL,13,Fclear periods. Chilly in some well
OL,14,Fsheltered glens.
OL,15,
OL,16,CFriday:FAfter a dry start there will
OL,17,Fbe some bright or sunny spells and a
OL,18,Ffew well scattered showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
